# Plan 11 — Template Editor: Visual Canvas (Design)

> **Plan #:** 11 · **Title:** Template Editor — Visual Canvas
> **Dependencies:** Plan 5 (GraphQL), Plan 10 (Template Editor Basic)
> **Dependents:** Plan 12 (Element Management), Plan 15 (Preview & Publishing)
> **Scope:** Drag-position elements, canvas rendering, element selection, snap guides, zoom/pan, rulers, keyboard shortcuts, undo/redo
> **Target:** Desktop primary (mobile uses simplified read-only view from Plan 10)
> **Permission:** `certificates.templates.manage` (canonical key per INTER_PLAN_CONTRACTS.md §1)

---

## 1. Architecture Overview

### 1.1 Data Flow Diagram

```
┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│                        USER INTERACTION                             │
│  Pointer Events (down/move/up)  ·  Keyboard  ·  Wheel (zoom)        │
└──────────────────────────┬──────────────────────────────────────────┘
                          │
                          ▼
┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│                     CANVAS VIEWPORT (DOM)                            │
│  ┌───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐   │
│  │  Canvas Container (position: relative, CSS transform: scale)  │   │
│  │  ┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐  │   │
│  │  │  Background Image Layer (template background)           │  │   │
│  │  ├─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤  │   │
│  │  │  Element Overlays (position: absolute, per element)     │  │   │
│  │  │  ┌──────┐ ┌──────┐ ┌──────┐                           │  │   │
│  │  │  │ Text │ │ Image│ │ QR   │  ← ElementRenderer         │  │   │
│  │  │  └──────┘ └──────┘ └──────┘                           │  │   │
│  │  ├─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤  │   │
│  │  │  Selection Handles Layer (resize, rotate, bounding box)  │  │   │
│  │  ├─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤  │   │
│  │  │  Snap Guide Overlay (alignment lines, grid dots)        │  │   │
│  │  └─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘  │   │
│  └───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘   │
│                     Canvas Rulers (top + left)                       │
└──────────────────────────┬──────────────────────────────────────────┘
                          │ Read/Write
                          ▼
┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│                   ZUSTAND CANVAS STORE (session-only)                │
│  elements[]  ·  selectedIds:string[]  ·  zoom  ·  grid  ·  history  │
│  isDirty  ·  isPanning  ·  interactionState                        │
│  Actions: select · add · updatePosition · resize · rotate · delete  │
│           undo · redo · setZoom · toggleGrid · markDirty             │
│           copySelection · paste · bringToFront · sendToBack          │
└──────────────────────────┬──────────────────────────────────────────┘
                          │ Debounced (300ms) — diff-only payload
                          ▼
┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│                   APOLLO CLIENT (GraphQL)                            │
│  updateTemplateElementsBulk Mutation (diff-only, expectedVersion)  │
└──────────────────────────┬──────────────────────────────────────────┘
                          │
                          ▼
                   PostgreSQL Database
```

### 1.2 Component Composition Flow

```
App Router Page: app/(dashboard)/certificates/templates/[templateId]/canvas/page.tsx
 └─ CanvasContainer (frontend/common/views/dashboard/cert-canvas/)
     └─ useCanvasViewModel() — ViewModel hook (all business logic)
     └─ CanvasView → ResponsiveViewSwitch (createLazyView)
         ├─ canvas.mobile.tsx (frontend/mobile/views/dashboard/cert-canvas/)
         │    → Read-only preview + "Edit on desktop" banner
         └─ canvas.desktop.tsx (frontend/desktop/views/dashboard/cert-canvas/)
              ├─ CanvasToolbar (add element, zoom, grid, undo/redo, save, edit menu, view toggles)
              ├─ LeftPanel (element type buttons + layer list)
              ├─ CanvasViewport (scrollable, pan-able container)
              │    ├─ CanvasRuler (top — horizontal)
              │    ├─ CanvasRuler (left — vertical)
              │    └─ CanvasSurface (position: relative, transform: scale)
              │         ├─ BackgroundImageLayer
              │         ├─ ElementRenderer[] (per element)
              │         │    └─ SelectionFrame (when selected)
              │         │         ├─ ResizeHandles (8 handles)
              │         │         └─ RotationHandle
              │         ├─ SnapGuideOverlay (alignment lines, grid dots)
              │         └─ MarqueeSelection (rubber-band rectangle)
              └─ PropertyPanel (right sidebar — position/size/rotation/type-specific)
```

### 1.3 Tier-Isolated File Scaffold

Per the Siraj mobile/desktop isolation architecture (`frontend/views/AGENTS.md`), the canvas follows the three-tier structure:

**Tier-neutral (shared):** `frontend/common/views/dashboard/cert-canvas/`
```
canvasContainer.tsx              # Container: calls useCanvasViewModel, passes to ResponsiveViewSwitch
canvasView.tsx                   # Switcher: createLazyView + ResponsiveViewSwitch
useCanvasViewModel.ts            # ViewModel hook: ALL business logic (Apollo, store, handlers)
types/
  canvas.types.ts                # CanvasElement, CanvasState, Tool, InteractionState, etc.
  canvas-commands.ts             # Command types for undo/redo
  canvas-guides.ts               # GuideLine, SnapGuide types
utils/
  canvasCoords.ts                # screenToTemplate, templateToScreen, zoom math
  snapUtils.ts                   # snap-to-grid, snap-to-element proximity detection
  elementFactory.ts              # createElement(type) → CanvasElement with defaults
hooks/
  useCanvasKeyboard.ts           # Keyboard shortcut hook (window listener + canvasFocus gating)
  useCanvasZoomPan.ts            # Zoom/pan hook (react-zoom-pan-pinch integration)
  useCanvasInteractions.ts       # Pointer event handlers (drag, resize, rotate, marquee)
components/
  CanvasSurface.tsx              # The zoomable canvas surface (TransformComponent child)
  ElementRenderer.tsx            # Renders a single element (memoized)
  BackgroundImageLayer.tsx       # Background image or color fallback
  SelectionFrame.tsx             # Selection border + group bounding box
  ResizeHandles.tsx              # 8 resize handles (corners + edges)
  RotationHandle.tsx             # Rotation handle above element
  SnapGuideOverlay.tsx           # SVG overlay: grid dots + alignment guides
  MarqueeSelection.tsx           # Marquee rubber-band rectangle
  CanvasRuler.tsx                # Pixel ruler (horizontal/vertical, shared component)
```

**Desktop-specific:** `frontend/desktop/views/dashboard/cert-canvas/`
```
canvas.desktop.tsx               # Desktop view: full canvas editor layout
components/
  CanvasToolbar.tsx              # Top toolbar: add element, zoom, grid, undo/redo, save
  LeftPanel.tsx                   # Left sidebar: element type buttons + layer list
  PropertyPanel.tsx              # Right sidebar: selected element properties
  ZoomControls.tsx                # Zoom in/out/fit/reset display (toolbar sub-component)
  LayerListItem.tsx              # Single layer row in left panel
```

**Mobile-specific:** `frontend/mobile/views/dashboard/cert-canvas/`
```
canvas.mobile.tsx                # Mobile view: read-only preview + "Edit on desktop" banner
```

**Zustand store:** `frontend/common/stores/certCanvasStore.ts`

**GraphQL documents:** `frontend/common/graphql/sharedDocuments/certificates/canvas.documents.ts`

**i18n namespace:** `shared/locale/{types,namespaces,ar,en}/dashboard/certificatesCanvas/`
- Translation handle: `Translation.Dashboard.CertificatesCanvas`
- Server access: `getTranslations(locale).dashboardTranslations.certificatesCanvas`
- Client hook: `useAppTranslation(Translation.Dashboard.CertificatesCanvas)`

**App Router page:** `app/(dashboard)/certificates/templates/[templateId]/canvas/page.tsx`

