## 13. Navigation & Route Specification

### 13.1 Route

| Attribute | Value |
|-----------|-------|
| Route path | `app/(dashboard)/certificates/templates/[templateId]/canvas/page.tsx` |
| Route segment | `(dashboard)` group — authenticated, sidebar layout |
| Dynamic param | `[templateId]` — UUID of the template being edited |
| Permission guard | `certificates.templates.manage` — checked in page Server Component via `getAuthContext()` |
| Sidebar entry | "Certificates" → "Templates" → (row "Edit Canvas" action navigates here) |
| Breadcrumbs | `Certificates › Templates › {templateName} › Canvas` |

### 13.2 Navigation Flow

```
Sidebar: "Certificates" (nav item)
  → "Templates" (sub-nav)
    → Template List page (Plan 10)
      → "Edit Canvas" button on template row
        → /certificates/templates/{templateId}/canvas → Canvas page (this plan)
```

### 13.3 Permission Integration

| Permission Key | Scope | Behavior |
|----------------|-------|----------|
| `certificates.templates.manage` | Full edit access | Can add, drag, resize, rotate, delete, save elements. Toolbar shows all controls. |
| `certificates.templates.view` | Read-only fallback | Canvas renders in non-interactive mode: `pointer-events: none` on all `ElementRenderer` instances; toolbar hides Add/Delete/Save; shows zoom + grid toggle only. |

**Route guard:** The page Server Component calls `getAuthContext()` and checks `hasPermission("certificates.templates.manage")`. If only `view` permission, passes `readOnly: true` to `CanvasContainer`. If neither, redirects to the unauthorized page.

**Read-only mode UI:**
- All `ElementRenderer` wrappers get `pointer-events: none` — no selection, no drag, no resize
- Toolbar shows: zoom controls, grid toggle, ruler toggle. Hides: add-element buttons, undo/redo, save, delete
- A read-only banner displays: `canvas.messages.readOnlyMode: "Read-only mode — you do not have edit permission"`
- Property panel is hidden

### 13.4 Desktop View Layout

#### Layout Structure

```
┌──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│                      Top Toolbar                           │
│  [File] [Edit] [View] [Zoom: 100%] [Undo] [Redo] [Save]    │
├──────┬─────────────────────────────────────────┬───────────┤
│ Left │              Center Canvas Area          │  Right    │
│ Panel│                                           │  Panel   │
│      │  ┌─ Ruler ──────────────────────────────┐ │          │
│ Tools│  │                                      │ │ Property │
│      │  │     ┌── A4 Canvas Surface ──┐         │ │ Panel    │
│ Text │  │  R  │                       │         │ │          │
│ Image│  │  u  │   Elements rendered    │         │ │ Position │
│ Shape│  │  l  │   here (absolute pos)  │         │ │ Size     │
│ QR   │  │  e  │                       │         │ │ Rotation │
│ Var  │  │  r  │                       │         │ │ Font     │
│      │  │  └───────────────────────────┘         │ │ Color    │
│ Layer│  └────────────────────────────────────────┘ │          │
│ List │                                           │          │
│      │             [Zoom: - 100% +]               │          │
├──────┴─────────────────────────────────────────┴───────────┤
```

#### Top Toolbar Components

| Group | Components | Controls |
|-------|-----------|----------|
| File menu | `FileMenu` dropdown | "Save" (Ctrl+S), "Export as PNG" (snapshot via `html-to-image`) |
| Edit menu | `EditMenu` dropdown | "Undo" (Ctrl+Z), "Redo" (Ctrl+Shift+Z), "Duplicate" (Ctrl+D), "Delete" (Del) |
| View toggles | `ViewToggle` buttons | Grid on/off, Rulers on/off, Snap on/off |
| Zoom indicator | `ZoomIndicator` | Current zoom % + zoom in/out/reset buttons (delegates to `ref.current.zoomIn/zoomOut/resetTransform`) |
| Save | `SaveButton` | Primary button; disabled when `!isDirty`; loading spinner when `isSaving` |

#### Left Panel Components

| Section | Component | Contents |
|---------|-----------|----------|
| Add Element | `AddElementPanel` | Buttons for: static_text (TextFields icon), data_text (TextFieldsOutlined), data_date (CalendarMonthOutlined), image (AddPhotoAlternateOutlined), qr_code (QrCode2Outlined), shape (ShapesOutlined) |
| Layer List | `LayerList` | Vertical list of elements sorted by zIndex descending (top layer first). Click to select. Eye icon to toggle visibility. Drag to reorder zIndex. Shows element type icon + truncated label. |

#### Right Panel — PropertyPanel

Section §15 (Element Rendering Specification) details per-type property layouts.

#### Context Menu (Right-Click)

| Trigger | Target | Menu Items |
|---------|--------|------------|
| Right-click on element | `ElementRenderer` | Duplicate, Delete, Bring to Front, Send to Back, Reorder Forward, Reorder Backward, Copy, Paste |
| Right-click on empty canvas | `CanvasSurface` | Paste, Select All, Add Element (submenu) |

### 13.5 Mobile View Layout

#### Layout Structure

```
┌──────────────────────────────┐
│        Top App Bar             │
│  [← Back] {templateName}       │
├──────────────────────────────┤
│                                │
│                                │
│     Canvas (fills screen)      │
│     react-zoom-pan-pinch       │
│     pinch-to-zoom enabled      │
│     two-finger pan             │
│                                │
│                                │
│                        [+] FAB │
├──────────────────────────────┤
│  [Undo]          [Zoom: 100%] │
├──────────────────────────────┤
│     Bottom Sheet (collapsible) │
│  Properties of selected element│
│  (when element selected)       │
└──────────────────────────────┘
```

#### Mobile Constraints

| Feature | Desktop | Mobile |
|---------|---------|--------|
| Multi-select | Ctrl+click, marquee | ❌ Not supported — single select only |
| Keyboard shortcuts | Full suite | ❌ Not available |
| Redo | Ctrl+Shift+Z | ❌ Undo only (no redo) |
| Rulers | Top + left | ❌ Hidden |
| Left tools panel | Dedicated panel | ❌ FAB with add-element menu |
| Right properties panel | Dedicated panel | ❌ Bottom sheet (collapsible) |
| Layer list | Visible in left panel | ❌ Hidden; access via FAB menu |
| Snap-to-grid | Toggle in toolbar | ❌ Disabled by default |
| Snap-to-elements | Active | ❌ Disabled |
| Rotation handle | Visible when selected | ❌ Hidden — rotation via bottom sheet numeric input only |
| Resize handles | 8 handles | ❌ Simplified to 4 corner handles only |
| Context menu | Right-click | ❌ Long-press → `Menu` component |

#### Mobile Touch Interactions

| Gesture | Action | Implementation |
|---------|--------|----------------|
| Tap on element | Select element | `onClick` handler — `selectElement(id)` |
| Tap on empty canvas | Deselect all | `onClick` on `TransformComponent` background — `deselectAll()` |
| Long-press on element | Open context menu (Duplicate, Delete, Layer order) | `onContextMenu` via touch timer (500ms threshold) |
| Long-press + drag on element | Drag element | `onPointerDown` starts drag after 500ms long-press threshold |
| Pinch (two fingers) | Zoom in/out | `react-zoom-pan-pinch` built-in pinch gesture (`pinch={{ enabled: true, step: 5 }}`) |
| Two-finger drag | Pan canvas | `react-zoom-pan-pinch` built-in pan (`panning: { disabled: false }`) — but only when two fingers detected; single-finger drag moves element |
| FAB tap | Open add-element `Menu` | `Menu` with `anchorEl` set to FAB position |
| Bottom sheet swipe down | Collapse sheet | `SwipeableDrawer` with `open` state bound to `selectedIds.length > 0` |

### 13.6 Responsive Breakpoints

| Breakpoint | Layout | Behavior |
|------------|--------|----------|
| ≥ 1280px (xl) | Full desktop layout | All panels visible, rulers, full toolbar with labels |
| 1024–1279px (lg) | Compact desktop | Full toolbar with icon-only buttons (labels in tooltips), left/right panels narrowed |
| 768–1023px (md) | Mobile layout | Canvas fills screen, FAB, bottom sheet, no rulers |
| < 768px (sm/xs) | Mobile layout | Same as md — simplified |

### 13.7 Accessibility

| Feature | Implementation |
|---------|----------------|
| Canvas ARIA role | `role="application"` on `CanvasContainer` with `aria-label` from `canvas.aria.canvasRegion` |
| Element ARIA | `role="group"` on each `ElementRenderer` with `aria-label` = element type + position (e.g., "Text element at x: 100, y: 200") |
| Keyboard focus | Canvas container is `tabIndex={0}` — receives focus for keyboard shortcuts |
| Escape exit | `Escape` blurs canvas (`container.blur()`) — returns focus to document Tab order; also triggers `deselectAll` |
| Focus indicators | 2px solid `theme.palette.primary.main` outline on focused element |
| Screen reader announcements | `aria-live="polite"` region announces: element added, element deleted, selection changed, drag coordinates during drag (debounced 200ms) |
| Toolbar accessibility | All `IconButton` components have `aria-label` from translations; dropdown menu items are keyboard navigable (`arrow keys`, `Enter`) |
| Ruler/grid | `aria-hidden="true"` — decorative only |
| Property panel | Form fields have `<label>` association; `Slider` components have `aria-label` |

### 13.8 Interaction States

| State | Trigger | Visual Feedback | Data State |
|-------|---------|-----------------|------------|
| Loading | Page navigation / template switch | `CircularProgress` centered on canvas area; toolbar disabled | `isLoading: true` in ViewModel |
| Load error | GraphQL query fails | `Alert` with severity "error": `canvas.messages.loadFailed`; "Retry" button calls `refetch()` | `loadError: Error` in ViewModel |
| Saving | User clicks Save or Ctrl+S | Save button shows `CircularProgress` (small, inline); toolbar disabled; `isSaving: true` in store | `isSaving: true` — disables undo/redo/add |
| Save error | GraphQL mutation fails | Toast notification (severity "error"): `canvas.messages.saveFailed`; element positions remain as user placed them (no revert mid-session) | `saveError: string` in ViewModel; `isDirty` remains `true` |
| Save success | Mutation completes | Toast (severity "success"): `canvas.messages.changesSaved`; `isDirty` set to `false`; dirty indicator clears | `isDirty: false`, `savedElements` snapshot updated |
| Empty canvas | Template has 0 elements | Centered placeholder: illustration + `canvas.messages.emptyCanvas: "No elements yet — use the toolbar to add text, images, and more"` | `elements.length === 0` |
| Element selected | Click on element | Selection frame with `theme.palette.primary.main` border; property panel populates | `selectedIds.length === 1` |
| Multi-select | Ctrl+click, marquee | Dashed selection rectangle around all selected; shared bounding box (read-only); property panel shows "N elements selected" with common actions only | `selectedIds.length > 1` |
| Dragging | Pointer down on element + move | Element follows cursor in real-time; `SelectionFrame` hides; ghost outline at original position (30% opacity); SR live region announces coordinates (debounced 200ms) | `interactionState: { type: "dragging", elementId }` |
| Resizing | Pointer down on resize handle | Dashed resize indicator; element dimensions update in real-time; width/height displayed as overlay near handle | `interactionState: { type: "resizing", elementId, handle }` |
| Rotating | Pointer down on rotation handle | Rotation angle displayed as overlay near handle; element rotates in real-time; 15° snap indicators appear at 0°/90°/180°/270° | `interactionState: { type: "rotating", elementId }` |
| Panning | Space+drag or middle mouse or trackpad scroll | Cursor becomes `grab`/`grabbing`; `TransformComponent` scrolls canvas | `interactionState: { type: "panning" }` or null (library handles internally) |
| Read-only | User lacks `certificates.templates.manage` | Read-only banner; no selection, no handles, no toolbar edit controls | `readOnly: true` prop on `CanvasContainer` |
| Version conflict | Save returns version mismatch | Dialog: `canvas.messages.versionConflict: "This template has been modified by another user. Reload to see their changes?"`; buttons: "Reload" (calls `refetch` + `resetToSaved`) or "Keep my changes" (force save with new version) | `saveError` contains conflict message |
 Unsaved-changes guard | User attempts navigation while `isDirty` | `beforeunload` event warns; in-app navigation shows `Dialog` confirm: `canvas.messages.confirmDiscard` | `isDirty: true` |

---

## 15. Element Rendering Specification

### 15.1 Element Type Rendering Contract

Each `ElementRenderer` component renders based on `element.type`. The rendering is inline to the canvas div — uses CSS where possible, SVG only for shapes that CSS cannot handle (ellipse stroke, line).

#### static_text

| Property | Type | Rendering |
|----------|------|-----------|
| `content` | `string` | Rendered as `<div>` with `whiteSpace: 'pre-wrap'`, `overflow: 'hidden'` |
| `fontFamily` | `string` | `style.fontFamily` |
| `fontSize` | `number` (px) | `style.fontSize` — evaluated at 72 DPI template scale |
| `fontWeight` | `400 \| 700` | `style.fontWeight` |
| `fontStyle` | `'normal' \| 'italic'` | `style.fontStyle` |
| `color` | `string` (hex) | `style.color` |
| `textAlign` | `'left' \| 'center' \| 'right'` | `style.textAlign` |
| `lineHeight` | `number` | `style.lineHeight` (unitless) |

**Text overflow policy:** `overflow: hidden` with a visual "overflow" warning badge (small `WarningAmberOutlined` icon at top-right corner, `theme.palette.warning.main`) when content height exceeds bounding box. Badge is `aria-hidden` and uses MUI `Tooltip`: `canvas.messages.textOverflow: "Text overflows bounding box — content may be clipped in the final PDF"`.

#### data_text (bound variable)

Renders identically to `static_text` but wraps `{variableValue}` instead of literal content. When no data is bound (no variable assigned), displays the `placeholder` text in `theme.palette.text.disabled`.

#### data_date (formatted date variable)

Renders formatted date string using the bound variable's value. Displays live date formatting when the variable is set, or placeholder text (e.g., "January 1, 2025") when no data is bound. The `dateFormat` property supports: `'full'`, `'long'`, `'medium'`, `'short'` — maps to browser `Intl.DateTimeFormat` in the user's locale.

#### image

| Property | Type | Rendering |
|----------|------|-----------|
| `src` | `string` (URL) | Renders `<img>` inside positioned div |
| `fit` | `'contain' \| 'cover' \| 'fill'` | `style.objectFit` |
| `opacity` | `0–1` | `style.opacity` |
| `borderRadius` | `number` (px) | `style.borderRadius` |

When `src` is empty (not yet uploaded), renders with dashed `theme.palette.divider` border + `AddPhotoAlternateOutlined` icon centered + placeholder text: `canvas.messages.addImage: "Click to add image"`.

#### qr_code

| Property | Type | Rendering |
|----------|------|-----------|
| `contentVariableId` | `string` (UUID) | Source variable for QR content |
| `errorCorrection` | `'L' \| 'M' \| 'Q' \| 'H'` | QR error correction level |

**Editor rendering placeholder:** Renders `QrCode2Outlined` icon (large) + text `canvas.messages.qrPlaceholder: "QR code — binds to variable at render time"`. Actual QR generation is handled by Plan 6 Puppeteer renderer at export time. The editor does NOT generate the QR image.

#### shape

| Property | Type | Rendering |
|----------|------|-----------|
| `shapeType` | `'rectangle' \| 'ellipse' \| 'line'` | Determines which geometry renders |
| `fillColor` | `string` (hex) | Background color (`rectangle`) / fill (`ellipse`) / n/a (`line`) |
| `strokeColor` | `string` (hex) | Border color |
| `strokeWidth` | `number` (px) | Border width |
| `borderRadius` | `number` (px) | Corner radius (`rectangle` only) |

**Rectangle:** `<div>` with `backgroundColor`, `border`, `borderRadius`. **Ellipse:** `<svg>` with `<ellipse>` for precise stroke control. **Line:** `<svg>` with `<line>` from top-left-ish corner to opposite corner.

### 15.2 PropertyPanel Layouts (Per Element Type)

#### PropertyPanel — static_text

| Row | Control | Writable | Default | Range |
|-----|---------|----------|---------|-------|
| Type label | `Typography` (read-only) — "Text Element" | — | — | — |
| Content | `OutlinedInput` multiline | `content` | `""` | Max 1000 chars (per Plan 12/Plan 6) |
| Font family | `Select` populated from `shared/constants/certFonts.ts` | `fontFamily` | `'Inter'` | System + Google Fonts list |
| Font size | `OutlinedInput` type=number + `Slider` | `fontSize` | `16` (px) | 8–72 |
| Font weight | `ToggleButtonGroup` (Regular/Bold) | `fontWeight` | `400` | 400, 700 |
| Font style | `ToggleButtonGroup` (Normal/Italic) | `fontStyle` | `'normal'` | 'normal', 'italic' |
| Color | Swatch display + `OutlinedInput` hex | `color` | `'#000000'` | Any hex |
| Text align | `ToggleButtonGroup` (left/center/right icons) | `textAlign` | `'left'` | left, center, right |
| Line height | `OutlinedInput` type=number + `Slider` | `lineHeight` | `1.2` | 0.8–3.0 |
| *Common section* | see §15.2.7 | — | — | — |

