| Row | Control | Writable | Default |
|-----|---------|----------|---------|
| Type label | "Dynamic Text Element" | — | — |
| Variable binding | `Select` showing available certificate variable names | `variableId` | (unset) |
| Placeholder | `OutlinedInput` — preview text when no data | `placeholder` | `"Text variable"` |
| Font family, size, weight, style, color, align, lineHeight | same as `static_text` above | | |

#### PropertyPanel — data_date

| Row | Control | Writable | Default |
|-----|---------|----------|---------|
| Type label | "Date Element" | — | — |
| Variable binding | `Select` showing date-type variable names | `variableId` | (unset) |
| Date format | `Select`: Full (`Intl Monday, January 1, 2025`), Long (`January 1, 2025`), Medium (`Jan 1, 2025`), Short (`1/1/25`) | `dateFormat` | `'medium'` |
| Font family, size, weight, style, color, align, lineHeight | same as `static_text` | | |

#### PropertyPanel — image

| Row | Control | Writable | Default |
|-----|---------|----------|---------|
| Type label | "Image Element" | — | — |
| Image src | `OutlinedInput` (URL) + "Upload" button | `src` | `""` |
| Fit mode | `Select`: Contain, Cover, Fill | `fit` | `'cover'` |
| Opacity | `Slider` | `opacity` | `1` | 0.1–1.0 |
| Border radius | `OutlinedInput` type=number + `Slider` | `borderRadius` | `0` | 0–100 (px) |
| *Common section* | see §15.2.7 | — | — | — |

#### PropertyPanel — qr_code

| Row | Control | Writable | Default |
|-----|---------|----------|---------|
| Type label | "QR Code Element" | — | — |
| Bound variable | `Select` showing names of text-type variables | `contentVariableId` | (unset) |
| Error correction | `Select`: Low (L), Medium (M), Quartile (Q), High (H) | `errorCorrection` | `'M'` |
| *Common section* | see §15.2.7 | — | — | — |

#### PropertyPanel — shape

| Row | Control | Writable | Default |
|-----|---------|----------|---------|
| Type label | "Shape Element" | — | — |
| Shape type | `Select`: Rectangle, Ellipse, Line | `shapeType` | `'rectangle'` |
| Fill color | Swatch display + `OutlinedInput` hex | `fillColor` | `'#FFFFFF'` |
| Stroke color | Swatch display + `OutlinedInput` hex | `strokeColor` | `'#000000'` |
| Stroke width | `OutlinedInput` type=number + `Slider` | `strokeWidth` | `1` | 0–20 px |
| Border radius | `OutlinedInput` type=number (rectangle only) | `borderRadius` | `0` | 0–100 px |
| *Common section* | see §15.2.7 | — | — | — |

#### PropertyPanel — Common Section (all element types)

| Row | Control | Writable |
|-----|---------|----------|
| X (px) | `OutlinedInput` type=number | `x` |
| Y (px) | `OutlinedInput` type=number | `y` |
| Width (px) | `OutlinedInput` type=number + `Slider` | `width` |
| Height (px) | `OutlinedInput` type=number + `Slider` | `height` |
| Rotation (deg) | `OutlinedInput` type=number + `Slider` | `rotation` |
| Z-index | `OutlinedInput` type=number (read-only display, cannot edit directly — use Layer List / context menu) | display only |

#### PropertyPanel — No Selection State

When `selectedIds.length === 0`, property panel shows:
- Typography: `messages.noSelection: "No element selected"` (via `t.messages.noSelection()`)

